cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the
  associated paper (see preferred-citation below).
title: >-
  GeneGCN: A Graph Convolutional Network for Cell-Type-Specific Gene
  Perturbation Analysis in Autism Spectrum Disorder
abstract: >-
  GeneGCN is a graph convolutional autoencoder that learns a reconstruction
  model of the healthy cortical transcriptome on a cell-cell similarity graph
  and scores genes by per-gene reconstruction-error deviation (RED) between
  patient and control cells. Applied to the Velmeshev et al. (2019) autism
  cortex snRNA-seq cohort, GeneGCN recovers cell-type-specific gene
  perturbations and surfaces SFARI ASD-risk genes across 17 cortical cell
  types.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-06-30"
license: MIT
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/NorahAwn/GeneGCN"
